			"notes": "Improved warning previews and settings, fixed clipped text and layout issues, and fixed warnings sticking around after changing display modes. Existing saved settings remain supported.\n\nInstall **one jar** matching your Minecraft version and loader:\n\n| Loader | Minecraft versions |\n| --- | --- |\n| Fabric | 1.20–1.20.6 |\n| Fabric | 1.21–1.21.5 |\n| Fabric | 1.21.6–1.21.8 |\n| Fabric | 1.21.9–1.21.11 |\n| Fabric | 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2, 26.2 |\n| Forge | 1.8.9 |\n\n**Fabric:** requires Fabric Loader 0.19.5+, Fabric API, and Fabric Language Kotlin. Mod Menu is optional; press H in game to open settings.\n\n**Forge:** tested with Forge 11.15.1.2318 and Java 8. No extra mod dependencies.\n\nThese exact jars passed isolated packaged-client checks across all 24 listed Minecraft/loader targets, including settings, previews, live health warnings, absorption, and game modes. Multiplayer, arbitrary mod packs, and human audible playback were not separately verified.\n\nThe complete ZIP contains all six jars and verification manifests; download an individual jar for normal installation."
